{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/675063-release-date","id":675063,"title":"Release Date?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-23T02:49:21-07:00","id":675063,"title":"Release Date?","content":"Hello!<br /> There's a release date for Beast: The Primordial? I'm looking forward to read this book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2457,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","user":"Ipergigio","date":". 09-23-2015, 05:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-30T01:16:15-07:00","id":682784,"title":"","content":"Same here. I am very curious if a release date for this book has been confirmed yet?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;A dark shape crawls out from your closet. At first it looks like it has a large zipper for a mouth, however as it gets closer you soon realize that it isn't a zipper at all but rows of sharp yellow teeth!&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7343-werescythe","name":"Werescythe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7343_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-30T01:23:47-07:00","id":682792,"title":"","content":"Books come out when they come out. The <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/category/news/monday-meeting/\" target=\"_blank\">Monday Meeting notes</a> tend to provide a decent running estimate of how close a given book is to being totally completed and released. As of <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/buon-giorno-parli-linglese-and-stuff-y-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">September 28th</a>, Beast is in the Layout portion of Art Direction.<br /> <br /> Given that guesses for Mage 2e's corebook release are tending towards the winter holidays and Beast is further along in the process than that, best estimate off-the-cuff is &quot;sometime in the next two months.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T06:06:50-07:00","id":689624,"title":"","content":"So, I just did the second proof for <b>Beast</b> (for context, &quot;did the second proof&quot; means &quot;went through the pdf and put in page numbers to replace all the p. XXs&quot;). At this point, the pdf goes to CCP for approvals, and then it'll get finished and, if the patterns holds, sent to Kickstarter backers. They'll have a chance to look through it and see if they catch any mistakes, which then get corrected, and then the whole thing gets put up for sale on PDF and POD. <br /> <br /> <i>When</i> will that happen? My best guess would be sometime in November, but I really can't say for sure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T15:20:05-07:00","id":690488,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackhatmatt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/675063-release-date?p=689624#post689624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I just did the second proof for <b>Beast</b> (for context, &quot;did the second proof&quot; means &quot;went through the pdf and put in page numbers to replace all the p. XXs&quot;). At this point, the pdf goes to CCP for approvals, and then it'll get finished and, if the patterns holds, sent to Kickstarter backers. They'll have a chance to look through it and see if they catch any mistakes, which then get corrected, and then the whole thing gets put up for sale on PDF and POD.<br /> <br /> <i>When</i> will that happen? My best guess would be sometime in November, but I really can't say for sure.</div> </div> </div> </div>I just got Kickstarter goose-pimples. Can't wait <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;The phrase 'flies on the heads of pins' appeared 43 times in that journal, sometimes in the middle of sentences or written in the margins.&quot;","edited":{"use